      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Woodstock%2C_Vermont",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In the late 1960s, the Victorian Woodstock Inn, rebuilt in 1892 from the old Eagle Hotel, was replaced by a neo‑colonial structure.",
